{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","id":"fa821d5a95e1cf6b01871294","canonicalUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244%40gmail.com/","channels":["linux-i2c"],"thread":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thread:lore-git:20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com","source":{"kind":"static-generated","canonicalThreadUrl":"https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244%40gmail.com/","fetchedAt":"2026-08-16T16:20:46.501Z","contentDigest":"lore-git:20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"},"subject":"[PATCH] i2c: mv64xxx: fix autosuspend cleanup","messages":{"20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com":{"id":"20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com","messageId":"20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com","references":[],"missingAncestorIds":[],"author":{"name":"Guangshuo Li","address":"lgs201920130244@gmail.com"},"replyTo":[],"to":[{"name":"Gregory CLEMENT","address":"gregory.clement@bootlin.com"},{"name":"Andi Shyti","address":"andi.shyti@kernel.org"},{"name":"Samuel Holland","address":"samuel@sholland.org"},{"name":"Wolfram Sang","address":"wsa@kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-i2c@vger.kernel.org"},{"name":"","address":"linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org"}],"cc":[{"name":"Guangshuo Li","address":"lgs201920130244@gmail.com"},{"name":"","address":"stable@vger.kernel.org"}],"timestamp":{"raw":"2026-08-12T08:58:08.000Z","iso":"2026-08-12T08:58:08.000Z","valid":true},"subject":"[PATCH] i2c: mv64xxx: fix autosuspend cleanup","mailingLists":[{"id":"linux-i2c.vger.kernel.org","displayName":"linux-i2c.vger.kernel.org"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"mv64xxx_i2c_probe() calls pm_runtime_use_autosuspend(), but the probe\nfailure and remove paths do not call the matching\npm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend() before disabling runtime PM."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"If the autosuspend delay is set to a negative value while autosuspend\nis enabled, the runtime PM core increments usage_count to prevent\nruntime suspend. Without undoing the autosuspend setting during\nteardown, this reference is not dropped and usage_count remains\nunbalanced."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Call pm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend() in both the probe failure and\nremove paths before disabling runtime PM to properly undo the\nautosuspend setting."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"This issue was found by manual code inspection."},{"kind":"code","text":"Fixes: e5c02cf54154 (\"i2c: mv64xxx: Add runtime PM support\")\nCc: stable@vger.kernel.org"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Signed-off-by: Guangshuo Li <lgs201920130244@gmail.com>"},{"kind":"patch","patchId":"patch:20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com:0:0"}],"patchIds":["patch:20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com:0:0"],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[]}},"rootIds":["20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{"patch:20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com:0:0":{"id":"patch:20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com:0:0","messageId":"20260812085808.3313948-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com","subject":"[PATCH] i2c: mv64xxx: fix autosuspend cleanup","commitMessage":[],"files":[{"oldPath":"drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-mv64xxx.c","newPath":"drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-mv64xxx.c","displayPath":"drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-mv64xxx.c","status":"modified","hunks":[{"header":"@@ -1069,6 +1069,7 @@ mv64xxx_i2c_probe(struct platform_device *pd)","oldStart":1069,"oldCount":6,"newStart":1069,"newCount":7,"lines":[{"kind":"context","text":"exit_free_irq:","oldLine":1069,"newLine":1069},{"kind":"context","text":"\tfree_irq(drv_data->irq, drv_data);","oldLine":1070,"newLine":1070},{"kind":"context","text":"exit_disable_pm:","oldLine":1071,"newLine":1071},{"kind":"addition","text":"\tpm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend(&pd->dev);","newLine":1072},{"kind":"context","text":"\tpm_runtime_disable(&pd->dev);","oldLine":1072,"newLine":1073},{"kind":"context","text":"\tif (!pm_runtime_status_suspended(&pd->dev))","oldLine":1073,"newLine":1074},{"kind":"context","text":"\t\tmv64xxx_i2c_runtime_suspend(&pd->dev);","oldLine":1074,"newLine":1075}]},{"header":"@@ -1083,6 +1084,7 @@ mv64xxx_i2c_remove(struct platform_device *pd)","oldStart":1083,"oldCount":6,"newStart":1084,"newCount":7,"lines":[{"kind":"context","text":"","oldLine":1083,"newLine":1084},{"kind":"context","text":"\ti2c_del_adapter(&drv_data->adapter);","oldLine":1084,"newLine":1085},{"kind":"context","text":"\tfree_irq(drv_data->irq, drv_data);","oldLine":1085,"newLine":1086},{"kind":"addition","text":"\tpm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend(&pd->dev);","newLine":1087},{"kind":"context","text":"\tpm_runtime_disable(&pd->dev);","oldLine":1086,"newLine":1088},{"kind":"context","text":"\tif (!pm_runtime_status_suspended(&pd->dev))","oldLine":1087,"newLine":1089},{"kind":"context","text":"\t\tmv64xxx_i2c_runtime_suspend(&pd->dev);","oldLine":1088,"newLine":1090},{"kind":"deletion","text":"- ","oldLine":1089},{"kind":"metadata","text":"2.43.0"},{"kind":"metadata","text":""},{"kind":"metadata","text":""}]}],"binary":false}],"trailers":[],"rawText":"diff --git a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-mv64xxx.c b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-mv64xxx.c\nindex 1acba628e16c..995b0e9b7f53 100644\n--- a/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-mv64xxx.c\n+++ b/drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-mv64xxx.c\n@@ -1069,6 +1069,7 @@ mv64xxx_i2c_probe(struct platform_device *pd)\n exit_free_irq:\n \tfree_irq(drv_data->irq, drv_data);\n exit_disable_pm:\n+\tpm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend(&pd->dev);\n \tpm_runtime_disable(&pd->dev);\n \tif (!pm_runtime_status_suspended(&pd->dev))\n \t\tmv64xxx_i2c_runtime_suspend(&pd->dev);\n@@ -1083,6 +1084,7 @@ mv64xxx_i2c_remove(struct platform_device *pd)\n \n \ti2c_del_adapter(&drv_data->adapter);\n \tfree_irq(drv_data->irq, drv_data);\n+\tpm_runtime_dont_use_autosuspend(&pd->dev);\n \tpm_runtime_disable(&pd->dev);\n \tif (!pm_runtime_status_suspended(&pd->dev))\n \t\tmv64xxx_i2c_runtime_suspend(&pd->dev);\n-- \n2.43.0\n\n","statistics":{"files":1,"additions":2,"deletions":1},"diagnostics":[]}}}}